==== hyperbricks yaml {!{html}} ====
html:
  - type: html
  - trimspace: "true"
  - value: "\n<p>HTML TEST</p>    \n    "
==== explainer ====
Property trimspace filters, when set to true, all leading and trailing white space removed, as defined by Unicode.
==== expected json ====
{
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<HTML>",
  "Enclose": "",
  "ExtraAttributes": null,
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "MetaDocDescription": "",
  "TrimSpace": true,
  "Value": "\n<p>HTML TEST</p>    \n    "
}

==== expected output ====
<p>HTML TEST</p>
